s revealed to be an undercover FBI agent whose brother was killed during the sting operation that led to Leo's arrest. Feeling betrayed, Leo takes Vincent hostage and flees. Their confrontation ends with one killing the other, depending on the players' actions.", "summary": "A Way Out is a cooperative action-adventure game designed exclusively for two-player split-screen play, either locally or online. Each player controls one of two protagonists, Leo and Vincent, who form a reluctant partnership to break out of prison. Gameplay involves stealth, combat, driving, and environmental puzzle-solving, with both characters taking different cooperative roles in each situation. The game features a branching narrative that unfolds simultaneously for both players through its split-screen presentation.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-way-out", "videos": [{"id": 14276, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "yGZGSdgJVPM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yGZGSdgJVPM", "title": "A Way Out Official Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yGZGSdgJVPM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 14504, "name": "E3 2017 Showcase", "video_id": "_ApSmPvxz1o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_ApSmPvxz1o", "title": "A Way Out Official Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_ApSmPvxz1o/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 17101, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "K_16pHHF0q8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K_16pHHF0q8", "title": "A Way Out - Meet Vincent and Leo", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/K_16pHHF0q8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 18740, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "VWvRa4D98Zg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VWvRa4D98Zg", "title": "A Way Out Official Game Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VWvRa4D98Zg/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "characters": [{"id": 11586, "name": "Linda"}, {"id": 11584, "name": "Leo"}, {"id": 11588, "name": "Harvey"}, {"id": 996, "name": "Alex"}, {"id": 11587, "name": "Emily"}, {"id"